    <h1>DWH app access control via Compass - current, future, transitional<=
/h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
 <div class=3D"columnLayout two-right-sidebar" data-layout=3D"two-right-sid=
ebar">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h1 id=3D"DWHappaccesscontrolviaCompasscurrent,future,transitional-Curr=
entState:Coupled">Current State: Coupled</h1>
    <p>Data Solutions (DWH) Web apps, totally 13 apps as of now, are integr=
ated to IIQ on auto-provisioning. Eligible employees are able to single sig=
non&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://webapps.nbin-datasoluti=
ons.ca/landing/Home/Index" rel=3D"nofollow">Data Solutions dashboard</a> an=
d access their apps.</p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"918353a3-e944-4059-8904-16d1a9892a06">Access request =
workflow: <a href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/spaces/NDSKW/pages/1846584538/Data=
+Solutions+WebApps-Access+Request" rel=3D"nofollow" style=3D"letter-spacing=
: 0.0px;">Data Solutions WebApps-Access Request - NBIN Data Services team -=
 Confluence</a></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"863bfc17-ed06-4b9b-8227-ecee8f4ddc31">Data Solutions =
Landing page:&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://webapps.nbin-=
datasolutions.ca/landing/Home/Index" rel=3D"nofollow">Data Solutions Apps</=
a></li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><u>Takeaways:</u></p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"418b2088-b424-4718-b795-bcd03df7e673">The DWH app acc=
ess are provisioned to the employee profiles in <strong>Okta NBC (employee)=
 tenant.</strong></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"a488f806-5745-4670-b8c2-d09f6ed56387">A&nbsp;<em><str=
ong>shortId&nbsp;</strong></em>user account will be managed in&nbsp;<strong=
>Compass</strong> manually for every employee eligible to DWH apps, but the=
 user accounts are not provisioned with any Compass access.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
   </div>
  </div>
