 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h3 id=3D"DWHappaccesscontrolviaCompasscurrent,future,transitional-2.Us=
erassignmentsinCompass">2. User assignments in Compass&nbsp;</h3>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"7a34c6ba-e40a-4938-b0c1-92d2a60b1d22">
      <p>DWH user administrators (Darwin/Jenny) will use the <a class=3D"ex=
ternal-link" href=3D"https://compass.nbin.ca/firm/COR/manage/dwh-users" rel=
=3D"nofollow">Manage DWH user page</a> in Compass to create or update the u=
ser account by:</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"a5afb52f-16d1-4f39-aed5-f92dcdedb713">Assigning <u>=
ONE</u> and only one <strong>DWH user group </strong>from the drop-down; an=
d</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"740e6f6b-ec7b-45af-bb8b-d217e0b9e6f4">Adding/updati=
ng as <u>MANY</u> <strong>DWH resources </strong>as appropriate from the dr=
op-down</li>
      </ul></li>
    </ul>
    <p>&nbsp;:warning:&nbsp; The user accounts are assigned to <strong>COR =
firm context only</strong>. The user id is the <em><strong>shortId </strong=
></em>of the employee.</p>
    <p><br></p>
