users will be able to update the&nbsp;<em>shortId </em>account in CX by add=
ing the appropriate DWH resources.</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"5e627a1a-5004-488e-8629-420c316a5fbb"><u>Error:<=
/u> If the <em>shortId</em> account is not found, the request must be postp=
oned until the employee has requested CX access and it has been completed.&=
