          <li data-uuid=3D"928ed03a-d297-4ae2-9498-8291a1e12a7b">IIQ de-pro=
visions the employee's CX access in Okta (NBC) tenant and Compass - no huma=
n intervention</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"fa6d0cab-90b5-4413-8fc5-1e011e1f0a4e">The <em>sh=
ortId </em>account will become Inactive in CX</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"00553237-3c07-4dc8-b948-bacd51383812">Employee w=
ill <u>not</u> be able to access Compass</li>
         </ul>
         <p>:warning: If the employee's DWH webapp access has not been revo=
ked, their access won't be impacted immediately. However, DWH admin users w=
on't be able to manage their account. Eventually, there will be an issue - =
it breaks the assumption.</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd" contenteditable=3D"false=
